{"video_id": "Y21OR1OPC9A", "channel_id": "UC4JX40jDee_tINbkjycV4Sg", "fetched_at": "2026-11-17T02:18:46.520958+00:00", "fetch_tool": "yt-dlp 2026.08.19", "caption_track_type": "creator_uploaded", "segments": [{"start_seconds": 0.0, "end_seconds": 1.83, "text": "What is a virtual environment?"}, {"start_seconds": 1.83, "end_seconds": 2.97, "text": "Well this is simply"}, {"start_seconds": 2.97, "end_seconds": 4.47, "text": "a self-contained location"}, {"start_seconds": 4.47, "end_seconds": 5.07, "text": "that enables you"}, {"start_seconds": 5.07, "end_seconds": 6.2, "text": "to maintain separate"}, {"start_seconds": 6.2, "end_seconds": 7.63, "text": "and isolated environments"}, {"start_seconds": 7.63, "end_seconds": 9.37, "text": "for your Python projects"}, {"start_seconds": 9.37, "end_seconds": 10.23, "text": "This isolation"}, {"start_seconds": 10.23, "end_seconds": 11.8, "text": "lets you manage dependencies"}, {"start_seconds": 11.8, "end_seconds": 13.23, "text": "versions and packages"}, {"start_seconds": 13.23, "end_seconds": 14.2, "text": "without conflicts"}, {"start_seconds": 14.2, "end_seconds": 16.03, "text": "across different projects"}, {"start_seconds": 16.03, "end_seconds": 16.7, "text": "When you work on"}, {"start_seconds": 16.7, "end_seconds": 18.1, "text": "multiple Python projects"}, {"start_seconds": 18.1, "end_seconds": 19.57, "text": "it's likely that some of them depend"}, {"start_seconds": 19.57, "end_seconds": 20.53, "text": "on different versions"}, {"start_seconds": 20.53, "end_seconds": 21.9, "text": "of external libraries"}, {"start_seconds": 21.9, "end_seconds": 23.63, "text": "or even Python itself"}, {"start_seconds": 23.63, "end_seconds": 24.93, "text": "Without virtual environments"}, {"start_seconds": 24.93, "end_seconds": 25.77, "text": "if you were to install"}, {"start_seconds": 25.77, "end_seconds": 27.37, "text": "every dependency globally"}, {"start_seconds": 27.37, "end_seconds": 28.47, "text": "you might run into issues"}, {"start_seconds": 28.47, "end_seconds": 29.33, "text": "where one project"}, {"start_seconds": 29.33, "end_seconds": 30.3, "text": "needs a different version"}, {"start_seconds": 30.3, "end_seconds": 32.27, "text": "of a library than another project"}, {"start_seconds": 32.27, "end_seconds": 34.57, "text": "This can lead to compatibility issues"}, {"start_seconds": 34.57, "end_seconds": 35.87, "text": "Virtual environment solved"}, {"start_seconds": 35.87, "end_seconds": 37.6, "text": "this issue by allowing each project"}, {"start_seconds": 37.6, "end_seconds": 38.6, "text": "to have its own set"}, {"start_seconds": 38.6, "end_seconds": 39.9, "text": "of installed packages"}, {"start_seconds": 39.9, "end_seconds": 41.4, "text": "independent of what's installed"}, {"start_seconds": 41.4, "end_seconds": 43.6, "text": "globally or in other environments"}, {"start_seconds": 43.6, "end_seconds": 45.53, "text": "So now let's look at how you create"}, {"start_seconds": 45.53, "end_seconds": 46.9, "text": "virtual environments"}, {"start_seconds": 46.9, "end_seconds": 47.57, "text": "So to begin"}, {"start_seconds": 47.57, "end_seconds": 49.07, "text": "we need to open up a terminal"}, {"start_seconds": 49.07, "end_seconds": 50.13, "text": "or a command prompt"}, {"start_seconds": 50.13, "end_seconds": 51.27, "text": "If you're a mac or Linux"}, {"start_seconds": 51.27, "end_seconds": 52.27, "text": "open up your terminal"}, {"start_seconds": 52.27, "end_seconds": 53.5, "text": "If you're on Windows open up"}, {"start_seconds": 53.5, "end_seconds": 54.2, "text": "a command prompt"}, {"start_seconds": 54.2, "end_seconds": 56.1, "text": "or a PowerShell instance"}, {"start_seconds": 56.1, "end_seconds": 56.6, "text": "From here"}, {"start_seconds": 56.6, "end_seconds": 57.43, "text": "we're going to navigate"}, {"start_seconds": 57.43, "end_seconds": 58.5, "text": "into the directory"}, {"start_seconds": 58.5, "end_seconds": 59.33, "text": "where we want to create"}, {"start_seconds": 59.33, "end_seconds": 61.0, "text": "a new virtual environment"}, {"start_seconds": 61.0, "end_seconds": 61.8, "text": "It's worth noting"}, {"start_seconds": 61.8, "end_seconds": 62.8, "text": "that virtual environments"}, {"start_seconds": 62.8, "end_seconds": 64.93, "text": "are simply directories on your system"}, {"start_seconds": 64.93, "end_seconds": 66.1, "text": "so you want to put them in a place"}, {"start_seconds": 66.1, "end_seconds": 66.97, "text": "that's logical"}, {"start_seconds": 66.97, "end_seconds": 69.03, "text": "like the location of a Python project"}, {"start_seconds": 69.03, "end_seconds": 70.83, "text": "that requires this environment"}, {"start_seconds": 70.83, "end_seconds": 71.43, "text": "In my case"}, {"start_seconds": 71.43, "end_seconds": 72.0, "text": "you can see that"}, {"start_seconds": 72.0, "end_seconds": 73.8, "text": "I'm in the example directory"}, {"start_seconds": 73.8, "end_seconds": 75.37, "text": "which is on my desktop"}, {"start_seconds": 75.37, "end_seconds": 76.67, "text": "So simply go to a directory"}, {"start_seconds": 76.67, "end_seconds": 77.4, "text": "where you want to create"}, {"start_seconds": 77.4, "end_seconds": 79.3, "text": "your virtual environment From here"}, {"start_seconds": 79.3, "end_seconds": 79.83, "text": "we're going to create"}, {"start_seconds": 79.83, "end_seconds": 80.7, "text": "a new environment"}, {"start_seconds": 80.7, "end_seconds": 82.17, "text": "using the built in vent"}, {"start_seconds": 82.17, "end_seconds": 84.3, "text": "v Command or VPN V"}, {"start_seconds": 84.3, "end_seconds": 84.9, "text": "Now it's worth"}, {"start_seconds": 84.9, "end_seconds": 86.27, "text": "noting that there are other tools"}, {"start_seconds": 86.27, "end_seconds": 87.17, "text": "that can do this"}, {"start_seconds": 87.17, "end_seconds": 89.27, "text": "Like Conda virtual envy"}, {"start_seconds": 89.27, "end_seconds": 91.1, "text": "pip envy and poetry"}, {"start_seconds": 91.1, "end_seconds": 93.3, "text": "But V envy is built into Python"}, {"start_seconds": 93.3, "end_seconds": 95.07, "text": "and it's the most common one"}, {"start_seconds": 95.07, "end_seconds": 96.4, "text": "Now the commands for creating"}, {"start_seconds": 96.4, "end_seconds": 97.2, "text": "and activating"}, {"start_seconds": 97.2, "end_seconds": 98.1, "text": "the virtual environment"}, {"start_seconds": 98.1, "end_seconds": 99.0, "text": "are slightly different"}, {"start_seconds": 99.0, "end_seconds": 100.33, "text": "for Mac or Windows"}, {"start_seconds": 100.33, "end_seconds": 102.07, "text": "but I'll run through both sets"}, {"start_seconds": 102.07, "end_seconds": 103.0, "text": "So if you're on Windows"}, {"start_seconds": 103.0, "end_seconds": 104.03, "text": "you're going to use this command"}, {"start_seconds": 104.03, "end_seconds": 105.07, "text": "which is Python"}, {"start_seconds": 105.07, "end_seconds": 107.93, "text": "hyphen M then V and then envy"}, {"start_seconds": 107.93, "end_seconds": 109.63, "text": "Now the envy part here at the end"}, {"start_seconds": 109.63, "end_seconds": 111.1, "text": "is the name of the environment"}, {"start_seconds": 111.1, "end_seconds": 111.9, "text": "You can name this"}, {"start_seconds": 111.9, "end_seconds": 113.1, "text": "anything that you like"}, {"start_seconds": 113.1, "end_seconds": 115.27, "text": "but it's convention to name it envy"}, {"start_seconds": 115.27, "end_seconds": 116.93, "text": "Now if you're on Mac or Linux"}, {"start_seconds": 116.93, "end_seconds": 118.13, "text": "you'll simply change the command"}, {"start_seconds": 118.13, "end_seconds": 119.5, "text": "to be Python three"}, {"start_seconds": 119.5, "end_seconds": 120.7, "text": "So in my case I'm a mac"}, {"start_seconds": 120.7, "end_seconds": 122.83, "text": "so I'm going to run Python 3-m"}, {"start_seconds": 122.83, "end_seconds": 123.87, "text": "the envy"}, {"start_seconds": 123.87, "end_seconds": 125.5, "text": "envy Now at this point"}, {"start_seconds": 125.5, "end_seconds": 127.47, "text": "it will create a new directory for us"}, {"start_seconds": 127.47, "end_seconds": 128.57, "text": "So if we type LS"}, {"start_seconds": 128.57, "end_seconds": 129.0, "text": "you'll see that"}, {"start_seconds": 129.0, "end_seconds": 129.93, "text": "we have the environment"}, {"start_seconds": 129.93, "end_seconds": 132.07, "text": "envy in this directory"}, {"start_seconds": 132.07, "end_seconds": 132.87, "text": "Now what we need to do"}, {"start_seconds": 132.87, "end_seconds": 134.6, "text": "is activate the virtual environment"}, {"start_seconds": 134.6, "end_seconds": 135.67, "text": "and to do that again"}, {"start_seconds": 135.67, "end_seconds": 136.3, "text": "the command will be"}, {"start_seconds": 136.3, "end_seconds": 137.5, "text": "slightly different depending"}, {"start_seconds": 137.5, "end_seconds": 139.17, "text": "if you're on Mac or Windows"}, {"start_seconds": 139.17, "end_seconds": 140.13, "text": "If you're on windows"}, {"start_seconds": 140.13, "end_seconds": 140.6, "text": "you're going to run"}, {"start_seconds": 140.6, "end_seconds": 141.77, "text": "the following command"}, {"start_seconds": 141.77, "end_seconds": 142.47, "text": "Now the command"}, {"start_seconds": 142.47, "end_seconds": 144.37, "text": "is this the name of your environment"}, {"start_seconds": 144.37, "end_seconds": 146.03, "text": "which in this case is envy"}, {"start_seconds": 146.03, "end_seconds": 148.87, "text": "slash scripts slash activate DOT B8"}, {"start_seconds": 148.87, "end_seconds": 150.6, "text": "Now for some reason that doesn't work"}, {"start_seconds": 150.6, "end_seconds": 152.57, "text": "You can try just slash activates"}, {"start_seconds": 152.57, "end_seconds": 154.8, "text": "or remove that by extension"}, {"start_seconds": 154.8, "end_seconds": 156.43, "text": "Now if you are on Mac or Linux"}, {"start_seconds": 156.43, "end_seconds": 157.8, "text": "the command is a little bit different"}, {"start_seconds": 157.8, "end_seconds": 159.77, "text": "This is going to be source"}, {"start_seconds": 159.77, "end_seconds": 162.53, "text": "envy slash bin"}, {"start_seconds": 162.53, "end_seconds": 164.9, "text": "and then slash activate like that"}, {"start_seconds": 164.9, "end_seconds": 166.03, "text": "And once you've activated"}, {"start_seconds": 166.03, "end_seconds": 166.77, "text": "the environment"}, {"start_seconds": 166.77, "end_seconds": 167.53, "text": "you should see that"}, {"start_seconds": 167.53, "end_seconds": 168.43, "text": "you get a prefix"}, {"start_seconds": 168.43, "end_seconds": 169.9, "text": "with the name of the environment"}, {"start_seconds": 169.9, "end_seconds": 171.87, "text": "appearing before the normal line"}, {"start_seconds": 171.87, "end_seconds": 172.6, "text": "in your terminal"}, {"start_seconds": 172.6, "end_seconds": 173.3, "text": "So whether you're on"}, {"start_seconds": 173.3, "end_seconds": 174.37, "text": "Mac Windows or Linux"}, {"start_seconds": 174.37, "end_seconds": 175.47, "text": "you'll know this is working"}, {"start_seconds": 175.47, "end_seconds": 176.3, "text": "Once you see the"}, {"start_seconds": 176.3, "end_seconds": 177.23, "text": "parentheses version"}, {"start_seconds": 177.23, "end_seconds": 178.3, "text": "of your environment name"}, {"start_seconds": 178.3, "end_seconds": 180.63, "text": "before your main terminal line"}, {"start_seconds": 180.63, "end_seconds": 181.53, "text": "Now that we're here"}, {"start_seconds": 181.53, "end_seconds": 182.1, "text": "I'll show you how"}, {"start_seconds": 182.1, "end_seconds": 183.57, "text": "we deactivate the environment"}, {"start_seconds": 183.57, "end_seconds": 184.97, "text": "So to go back into our global"}, {"start_seconds": 184.97, "end_seconds": 186.33, "text": "Python installation"}, {"start_seconds": 186.33, "end_seconds": 186.9, "text": "To do that"}, {"start_seconds": 186.9, "end_seconds": 188.4, "text": "you simply type deactivate"}, {"start_seconds": 188.4, "end_seconds": 189.47, "text": "The command will be the same"}, {"start_seconds": 189.47, "end_seconds": 190.5, "text": "Whether you're on Mac"}, {"start_seconds": 190.5, "end_seconds": 191.77, "text": "Windows or Linux"}, {"start_seconds": 191.77, "end_seconds": 192.9, "text": "Then we can reactivate"}, {"start_seconds": 192.9, "end_seconds": 193.4, "text": "by using the"}, {"start_seconds": 193.4, "end_seconds": 194.37, "text": "source command again"}, {"start_seconds": 194.37, "end_seconds": 195.6, "text": "Or that activate script"}, {"start_seconds": 195.6, "end_seconds": 197.27, "text": "that I showed you on Windows"}, {"start_seconds": 197.27, "end_seconds": 198.3, "text": "So now that the environment"}, {"start_seconds": 198.3, "end_seconds": 199.73, "text": "is created and activated"}, {"start_seconds": 199.73, "end_seconds": 200.4, "text": "we can go ahead"}, {"start_seconds": 200.4, "end_seconds": 202.5, "text": "and install some packages into it"}, {"start_seconds": 202.5, "end_seconds": 203.2, "text": "Now to do this"}, {"start_seconds": 203.2, "end_seconds": 204.53, "text": "we're going to use the PIP command"}, {"start_seconds": 204.53, "end_seconds": 205.07, "text": "which stands"}, {"start_seconds": 205.07, "end_seconds": 207.1, "text": "for the preferred installer program"}, {"start_seconds": 207.1, "end_seconds": 208.27, "text": "or the RECURSIVE acronym"}, {"start_seconds": 208.27, "end_seconds": 210.3, "text": "which is PIP installs packages"}, {"start_seconds": 210.3, "end_seconds": 211.87, "text": "Now if we want to view the packages"}, {"start_seconds": 211.87, "end_seconds": 213.1, "text": "that are in the current environment"}, {"start_seconds": 213.1, "end_seconds": 215.37, "text": "we can start by typing PIP list"}, {"start_seconds": 215.37, "end_seconds": 216.0, "text": "and it will show us"}, {"start_seconds": 216.0, "end_seconds": 217.5, "text": "that we can actually upgrade PIP"}, {"start_seconds": 217.5, "end_seconds": 218.13, "text": "if we'd like to"}, {"start_seconds": 218.13, "end_seconds": 219.87, "text": "We don't need to do that right now"}, {"start_seconds": 219.87, "end_seconds": 220.5, "text": "but we can see that"}, {"start_seconds": 220.5, "end_seconds": 221.67, "text": "we just have two packages"}, {"start_seconds": 221.67, "end_seconds": 223.07, "text": "PIP and set setup tools"}, {"start_seconds": 223.07, "end_seconds": 223.87, "text": "The reason we don't see"}, {"start_seconds": 223.87, "end_seconds": 224.5, "text": "any other ones"}, {"start_seconds": 224.5, "end_seconds": 224.9, "text": "is because"}, {"start_seconds": 224.9, "end_seconds": 226.67, "text": "we're in the virtual environment now"}, {"start_seconds": 226.67, "end_seconds": 228.77, "text": "not in our global version of Python"}, {"start_seconds": 228.77, "end_seconds": 230.03, "text": "If we were to deactivate this"}, {"start_seconds": 230.03, "end_seconds": 231.3, "text": "and run the command again"}, {"start_seconds": 231.3, "end_seconds": 232.53, "text": "we'd see any packages"}, {"start_seconds": 232.53, "end_seconds": 233.83, "text": "in our global environment"}, {"start_seconds": 233.83, "end_seconds": 235.93, "text": "But here we're in the virtual one"}, {"start_seconds": 235.93, "end_seconds": 236.7, "text": "Now that we've done that"}, {"start_seconds": 236.7, "end_seconds": 237.9, "text": "we can install a package"}, {"start_seconds": 237.9, "end_seconds": 238.5, "text": "So one"}, {"start_seconds": 238.5, "end_seconds": 239.57, "text": "some of us have probably used"}, {"start_seconds": 239.57, "end_seconds": 241.9, "text": "before is the request package"}, {"start_seconds": 241.9, "end_seconds": 244.1, "text": "So let's go PIP install requests"}, {"start_seconds": 244.1, "end_seconds": 244.93, "text": "When we do that"}, {"start_seconds": 244.93, "end_seconds": 246.27, "text": "it should install everything"}, {"start_seconds": 246.27, "end_seconds": 247.93, "text": "And if we type PIP list"}, {"start_seconds": 247.93, "end_seconds": 248.33, "text": "you'll see"}, {"start_seconds": 248.33, "end_seconds": 248.9, "text": "now that we get"}, {"start_seconds": 248.9, "end_seconds": 250.4, "text": "all of the dependencies for requests"}, {"start_seconds": 250.4, "end_seconds": 252.3, "text": "as well as the request package itself"}, {"start_seconds": 252.3, "end_seconds": 252.87, "text": "You'll notice"}, {"start_seconds": 252.87, "end_seconds": 254.7, "text": "now if I deactivate the environment"}, {"start_seconds": 254.7, "end_seconds": 256.6, "text": "and I type PIP list"}, {"start_seconds": 256.6, "end_seconds": 257.6, "text": "it's actually needs to be Pip"}, {"start_seconds": 257.6, "end_seconds": 258.33, "text": "three here"}, {"start_seconds": 258.33, "end_seconds": 259.77, "text": "I'll get a huge long list"}, {"start_seconds": 259.77, "end_seconds": 261.0, "text": "of a bunch of other packages"}, {"start_seconds": 261.0, "end_seconds": 262.3, "text": "that are installed globally"}, {"start_seconds": 262.3, "end_seconds": 263.37, "text": "Whereas if I go back"}, {"start_seconds": 263.37, "end_seconds": 265.23, "text": "into the environment here"}, {"start_seconds": 265.23, "end_seconds": 266.57, "text": "and I type PIP list"}, {"start_seconds": 266.57, "end_seconds": 267.67, "text": "we just see the ones that are"}, {"start_seconds": 267.67, "end_seconds": 269.1, "text": "part of this environment"}, {"start_seconds": 269.1, "end_seconds": 270.6, "text": "So now at this point let's imagine"}, {"start_seconds": 270.6, "end_seconds": 271.6, "text": "we've done some intense"}, {"start_seconds": 271.6, "end_seconds": 272.6, "text": "Python development"}, {"start_seconds": 272.6, "end_seconds": 273.07, "text": "and we're ready"}, {"start_seconds": 273.07, "end_seconds": 274.3, "text": "to push this to GitHub"}, {"start_seconds": 274.3, "end_seconds": 276.1, "text": "or share a project with someone else"}, {"start_seconds": 276.1, "end_seconds": 277.07, "text": "Now in order for them"}, {"start_seconds": 277.07, "end_seconds": 278.0, "text": "to run this code"}, {"start_seconds": 278.0, "end_seconds": 278.7, "text": "they'll likely need"}, {"start_seconds": 278.7, "end_seconds": 280.17, "text": "the same requirements as us"}, {"start_seconds": 280.17, "end_seconds": 281.67, "text": "Now rather than exporting"}, {"start_seconds": 281.67, "end_seconds": 283.07, "text": "our entire environment"}, {"start_seconds": 283.07, "end_seconds": 284.4, "text": "we can simply save a list"}, {"start_seconds": 284.4, "end_seconds": 285.57, "text": "of all of the dependencies"}, {"start_seconds": 285.57, "end_seconds": 287.27, "text": "we used into a requirement"}, {"start_seconds": 287.27, "end_seconds": 288.57, "text": "The text file"}, {"start_seconds": 288.57, "end_seconds": 289.6, "text": "Now to do that"}, {"start_seconds": 289.6, "end_seconds": 290.2, "text": "we're going to use"}, {"start_seconds": 290.2, "end_seconds": 291.33, "text": "the following command"}, {"start_seconds": 291.33, "end_seconds": 293.03, "text": "which is Pip frees"}, {"start_seconds": 293.03, "end_seconds": 293.67, "text": "We're going to use"}, {"start_seconds": 293.67, "end_seconds": 295.0, "text": "the greater than sign"}, {"start_seconds": 295.0, "end_seconds": 296.3, "text": "and then we're going to type"}, {"start_seconds": 296.3, "end_seconds": 298.6, "text": "requirements dot text"}, {"start_seconds": 298.6, "end_seconds": 300.3, "text": "if I spell that correctly"}, {"start_seconds": 300.3, "end_seconds": 301.27, "text": "And what this will do is"}, {"start_seconds": 301.27, "end_seconds": 302.8, "text": "take the output of PIP frees"}, {"start_seconds": 302.8, "end_seconds": 303.33, "text": "which gives us"}, {"start_seconds": 303.33, "end_seconds": 304.63, "text": "all of the different packages"}, {"start_seconds": 304.63, "end_seconds": 305.53, "text": "and their version"}, {"start_seconds": 305.53, "end_seconds": 307.2, "text": "and save it in this file"}, {"start_seconds": 307.2, "end_seconds": 309.03, "text": "So when I do that and I type LS"}, {"start_seconds": 309.03, "end_seconds": 309.53, "text": "you'll see that"}, {"start_seconds": 309.53, "end_seconds": 310.63, "text": "now we get a requirement"}, {"start_seconds": 310.63, "end_seconds": 312.0, "text": "start text file"}, {"start_seconds": 312.0, "end_seconds": 313.47, "text": "if we have a look at requirements"}, {"start_seconds": 313.47, "end_seconds": 314.2, "text": "dot text"}, {"start_seconds": 314.2, "end_seconds": 316.33, "text": "it has the output of PIP list"}, {"start_seconds": 316.33, "end_seconds": 318.0, "text": "that we looked at before"}, {"start_seconds": 318.0, "end_seconds": 319.37, "text": "Now let's get out of this here"}, {"start_seconds": 319.37, "end_seconds": 321.13, "text": "and let's see how we could use"}, {"start_seconds": 321.13, "end_seconds": 322.97, "text": "the requirements of text file"}, {"start_seconds": 322.97, "end_seconds": 323.53, "text": "to actually"}, {"start_seconds": 323.53, "end_seconds": 325.37, "text": "install these various packages"}, {"start_seconds": 325.37, "end_seconds": 326.1, "text": "So let's imagine"}, {"start_seconds": 326.1, "end_seconds": 327.13, "text": "we're someone else We've now"}, {"start_seconds": 327.13, "end_seconds": 328.8, "text": "got access to this code"}, {"start_seconds": 328.8, "end_seconds": 330.0, "text": "We want to start working in it"}, {"start_seconds": 330.0, "end_seconds": 331.17, "text": "and we have a requirement"}, {"start_seconds": 331.17, "end_seconds": 332.33, "text": "start text file"}, {"start_seconds": 332.33, "end_seconds": 333.07, "text": "Well first"}, {"start_seconds": 333.07, "end_seconds": 333.77, "text": "we'll make sure that we're"}, {"start_seconds": 333.77, "end_seconds": 334.87, "text": "out of this environment"}, {"start_seconds": 334.87, "end_seconds": 335.77, "text": "and we'll probably end"}, {"start_seconds": 335.77, "end_seconds": 336.87, "text": "up creating a new one"}, {"start_seconds": 336.87, "end_seconds": 337.73, "text": "So we'll start again"}, {"start_seconds": 337.73, "end_seconds": 338.23, "text": "and we'll type"}, {"start_seconds": 338.23, "end_seconds": 339.37, "text": "the commands In this case"}, {"start_seconds": 339.37, "end_seconds": 340.83, "text": "Python three hyphen M"}, {"start_seconds": 340.83, "end_seconds": 342.23, "text": "Then we will just call this"}, {"start_seconds": 342.23, "end_seconds": 343.33, "text": "my underscore"}, {"start_seconds": 343.33, "end_seconds": 345.8, "text": "and we will create a new environment"}, {"start_seconds": 345.8, "end_seconds": 346.93, "text": "We will then activate it"}, {"start_seconds": 346.93, "end_seconds": 348.3, "text": "So this will be source"}, {"start_seconds": 348.3, "end_seconds": 351.53, "text": "and then my envy slash bean slash"}, {"start_seconds": 351.53, "end_seconds": 353.27, "text": "activate again on windows"}, {"start_seconds": 353.27, "end_seconds": 354.37, "text": "is going to be a different command"}, {"start_seconds": 354.37, "end_seconds": 355.5, "text": "for activation"}, {"start_seconds": 355.5, "end_seconds": 356.97, "text": "Now we're inside of this environment"}, {"start_seconds": 356.97, "end_seconds": 358.57, "text": "This is a new environment"}, {"start_seconds": 358.57, "end_seconds": 359.33, "text": "and you'll notice that"}, {"start_seconds": 359.33, "end_seconds": 360.1, "text": "now we have"}, {"start_seconds": 360.1, "end_seconds": 362.67, "text": "envy might envy our requirements"}, {"start_seconds": 362.67, "end_seconds": 364.07, "text": "Dot text"}, {"start_seconds": 364.07, "end_seconds": 365.97, "text": "If I pip list inside of here"}, {"start_seconds": 365.97, "end_seconds": 366.37, "text": "you'll see that"}, {"start_seconds": 366.37, "end_seconds": 368.03, "text": "we don't have those requirements"}, {"start_seconds": 368.03, "end_seconds": 370.1, "text": "So the request module that we need"}, {"start_seconds": 370.1, "end_seconds": 371.53, "text": "but we can install them"}, {"start_seconds": 371.53, "end_seconds": 372.83, "text": "using this requirements"}, {"start_seconds": 372.83, "end_seconds": 374.37, "text": "dot text file"}, {"start_seconds": 374.37, "end_seconds": 375.0, "text": "To do that"}, {"start_seconds": 375.0, "end_seconds": 377.2, "text": "we very simply just type pip"}, {"start_seconds": 377.2, "end_seconds": 380.73, "text": "install dash ah and then requirements"}, {"start_seconds": 380.73, "end_seconds": 381.93, "text": "dot text"}, {"start_seconds": 381.93, "end_seconds": 382.47, "text": "the dash"}, {"start_seconds": 382.47, "end_seconds": 385.07, "text": "our stands for install from a file"}, {"start_seconds": 385.07, "end_seconds": 386.53, "text": "So we specify the file name"}, {"start_seconds": 386.53, "end_seconds": 388.37, "text": "which is requirements start text"}, {"start_seconds": 388.37, "end_seconds": 389.4, "text": "And now what pip will do"}, {"start_seconds": 389.4, "end_seconds": 390.83, "text": "is read this file"}, {"start_seconds": 390.83, "end_seconds": 392.23, "text": "find all of the requirements"}, {"start_seconds": 392.23, "end_seconds": 394.73, "text": "and install it in this environment"}, {"start_seconds": 394.73, "end_seconds": 395.9, "text": "So when I hit enter here it's"}, {"start_seconds": 395.9, "end_seconds": 397.5, "text": "going to go ahead and install that"}, {"start_seconds": 397.5, "end_seconds": 399.47, "text": "And now if we type PIP list"}, {"start_seconds": 399.47, "end_seconds": 400.73, "text": "you'll see that we get a list"}, {"start_seconds": 400.73, "end_seconds": 402.47, "text": "of all of the different packages"}, {"start_seconds": 402.47, "end_seconds": 404.1, "text": "that were from our requirements"}, {"start_seconds": 404.1, "end_seconds": 405.5, "text": "dot text file"}, {"start_seconds": 405.5, "end_seconds": 407.1, "text": "So this is very common practice"}, {"start_seconds": 407.1, "end_seconds": 408.2, "text": "You'll actually download"}, {"start_seconds": 408.2, "end_seconds": 409.43, "text": "a python project"}, {"start_seconds": 409.43, "end_seconds": 410.43, "text": "you'll see a requirements"}, {"start_seconds": 410.43, "end_seconds": 411.73, "text": "dot text file"}, {"start_seconds": 411.73, "end_seconds": 412.5, "text": "What's expected"}, {"start_seconds": 412.5, "end_seconds": 413.4, "text": "from that point forward"}, {"start_seconds": 413.4, "end_seconds": 414.03, "text": "is you're going to create"}, {"start_seconds": 414.03, "end_seconds": 415.5, "text": "a new virtual environment"}, {"start_seconds": 415.5, "end_seconds": 416.57, "text": "you're going to activate it"}, {"start_seconds": 416.57, "end_seconds": 417.67, "text": "You're then going to install"}, {"start_seconds": 417.67, "end_seconds": 419.0, "text": "all of the different packages"}, {"start_seconds": 419.0, "end_seconds": 420.13, "text": "using the requirements"}, {"start_seconds": 420.13, "end_seconds": 422.23, "text": "dot text file Again"}, {"start_seconds": 422.23, "end_seconds": 424.37, "text": "that command was pip install hyphen"}, {"start_seconds": 424.37, "end_seconds": 427.0, "text": "ah requirements dot text"}, {"start_seconds": 427.0, "end_seconds": 428.1, "text": "Now at this point you've learned"}, {"start_seconds": 428.1, "end_seconds": 429.5, "text": "how to create an environment"}, {"start_seconds": 429.5, "end_seconds": 430.27, "text": "activate it"}, {"start_seconds": 430.27, "end_seconds": 432.07, "text": "install individual packages"}, {"start_seconds": 432.07, "end_seconds": 433.9, "text": "install packages from a file"}, {"start_seconds": 433.9, "end_seconds": 435.17, "text": "and save your packages"}, {"start_seconds": 435.17, "end_seconds": 436.03, "text": "or dependencies"}, {"start_seconds": 436.03, "end_seconds": 438.47, "text": "into a requirements done text file"}, {"start_seconds": 438.47, "end_seconds": 439.63, "text": "You pretty much know everything"}, {"start_seconds": 439.63, "end_seconds": 439.97, "text": "you need"}, {"start_seconds": 439.97, "end_seconds": 441.6, "text": "to about virtual environments"}, {"start_seconds": 441.6, "end_seconds": 442.27, "text": "but I'll share with you"}, {"start_seconds": 442.27, "end_seconds": 443.97, "text": "a few last helpful tips"}, {"start_seconds": 443.97, "end_seconds": 445.77, "text": "that you'll probably want to know"}, {"start_seconds": 445.77, "end_seconds": 447.4, "text": "So first of all it's common practice"}, {"start_seconds": 447.4, "end_seconds": 448.9, "text": "to create a virtual environment"}, {"start_seconds": 448.9, "end_seconds": 451.07, "text": "folder inside of the directory"}, {"start_seconds": 451.07, "end_seconds": 453.2, "text": "where your Python files exist"}, {"start_seconds": 453.2, "end_seconds": 454.0, "text": "So for example"}, {"start_seconds": 454.0, "end_seconds": 454.47, "text": "maybe I'll make"}, {"start_seconds": 454.47, "end_seconds": 456.0, "text": "a new directory called project"}, {"start_seconds": 456.0, "end_seconds": 456.63, "text": "and this is where"}, {"start_seconds": 456.63, "end_seconds": 458.13, "text": "I'm going to have all of my code"}, {"start_seconds": 458.13, "end_seconds": 459.77, "text": "so CD into project"}, {"start_seconds": 459.77, "end_seconds": 461.43, "text": "and maybe I have a python file"}, {"start_seconds": 461.43, "end_seconds": 462.6, "text": "so I can say"}, {"start_seconds": 462.6, "end_seconds": 466.3, "text": "maybe just touch main dot p y"}, {"start_seconds": 466.37, "end_seconds": 467.87, "text": "Now what I would do is create"}, {"start_seconds": 467.87, "end_seconds": 469.07, "text": "my virtual environment"}, {"start_seconds": 469.07, "end_seconds": 470.93, "text": "inside of this directory"}, {"start_seconds": 470.93, "end_seconds": 472.5, "text": "So it's alongside my python"}, {"start_seconds": 472.5, "end_seconds": 474.43, "text": "files in all of my source code"}, {"start_seconds": 474.43, "end_seconds": 475.4, "text": "Now it's common practice"}, {"start_seconds": 475.4, "end_seconds": 477.97, "text": "that we call this envy or VM envy"}, {"start_seconds": 477.97, "end_seconds": 478.53, "text": "You can call it"}, {"start_seconds": 478.53, "end_seconds": 479.2, "text": "whatever you want"}, {"start_seconds": 479.2, "end_seconds": 480.23, "text": "but typically this is"}, {"start_seconds": 480.23, "end_seconds": 481.33, "text": "what it will be nicked"}, {"start_seconds": 481.33, "end_seconds": 482.33, "text": "Now once we create"}, {"start_seconds": 482.33, "end_seconds": 483.83, "text": "and activate the environment"}, {"start_seconds": 483.83, "end_seconds": 484.57, "text": "we want to make sure"}, {"start_seconds": 484.57, "end_seconds": 486.77, "text": "we don't save any of our source code"}, {"start_seconds": 486.77, "end_seconds": 488.5, "text": "inside of that directory"}, {"start_seconds": 488.5, "end_seconds": 489.6, "text": "So I'm not going to do it right now"}, {"start_seconds": 489.6, "end_seconds": 490.93, "text": "But let's say that we have"}, {"start_seconds": 490.93, "end_seconds": 492.37, "text": "this event V folder right?"}, {"start_seconds": 492.37, "end_seconds": 493.37, "text": "So it may end up high"}, {"start_seconds": 493.37, "end_seconds": 494.1, "text": "And then V"}, {"start_seconds": 494.1, "end_seconds": 495.43, "text": "where our virtual environment is"}, {"start_seconds": 495.43, "end_seconds": 495.87, "text": "we're not going"}, {"start_seconds": 495.87, "end_seconds": 497.17, "text": "to put any of our custom"}, {"start_seconds": 497.17, "end_seconds": 498.87, "text": "python code inside of here"}, {"start_seconds": 498.87, "end_seconds": 499.63, "text": "It's just going to sit"}, {"start_seconds": 499.63, "end_seconds": 501.17, "text": "inside of the main directory"}, {"start_seconds": 501.17, "end_seconds": 501.93, "text": "This folder is"}, {"start_seconds": 501.93, "end_seconds": 502.77, "text": "only used for"}, {"start_seconds": 502.77, "end_seconds": 504.13, "text": "storing the things related"}, {"start_seconds": 504.13, "end_seconds": 505.8, "text": "to our virtual environment"}, {"start_seconds": 505.8, "end_seconds": 506.57, "text": "That's about it"}, {"start_seconds": 506.57, "end_seconds": 507.33, "text": "If you're finished"}, {"start_seconds": 507.33, "end_seconds": 508.37, "text": "with the virtual environment"}, {"start_seconds": 508.37, "end_seconds": 509.1, "text": "and for some reason"}, {"start_seconds": 509.1, "end_seconds": 510.13, "text": "you don't need it anymore"}, {"start_seconds": 510.13, "end_seconds": 511.93, "text": "you can simply delete this folder"}, {"start_seconds": 511.93, "end_seconds": 513.43, "text": "and that's all you have to do"}, {"start_seconds": 513.43, "end_seconds": 514.17, "text": "So if you're on Mac"}, {"start_seconds": 514.17, "end_seconds": 515.37, "text": "you can type something like Ram"}, {"start_seconds": 515.37, "end_seconds": 517.4, "text": "Dash r v Envy"}, {"start_seconds": 517.4, "end_seconds": 519.3, "text": "that's going to delete the directory"}, {"start_seconds": 519.3, "end_seconds": 520.9, "text": "You also can just simply find it"}, {"start_seconds": 520.9, "end_seconds": 521.77, "text": "and delete it So"}, {"start_seconds": 521.77, "end_seconds": 523.27, "text": "right click it move it to trash"}, {"start_seconds": 523.27, "end_seconds": 524.13, "text": "whatever you want"}, {"start_seconds": 524.13, "end_seconds": 524.77, "text": "Now that's it"}, {"start_seconds": 524.77, "end_seconds": 525.83, "text": "That's all I have for you"}, {"start_seconds": 525.83, "end_seconds": 527.3, "text": "If you enjoy my teaching style"}, {"start_seconds": 527.3, "end_seconds": 528.67, "text": "and you want to become a developer"}, {"start_seconds": 528.67, "end_seconds": 529.2, "text": "then consider"}, {"start_seconds": 529.2, 